    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "comment-intro",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🎙️ Audio To Image\n\nSpeak a description and watch it become an image. Use it when you would rather describe a picture out loud than type a prompt.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Record audio\" holds a voice clip. \"2 Transcribe\" turns it into text with GPT-4o Mini Transcribe on OpenAI. That text becomes the prompt of \"3 Generate image\", which renders a 1:1, 1K image with FLUX.1 Schnell on fal, and the output node shows it. Transcription needs an OpenAI key and the image needs a fal key.\n\n**Try this:** Set \"aspect_ratio\" on \"3 Generate image\" to 16:9 and record the same description to get a wide version."
        },
